  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "make 是常考单词，所以学生一定要掌握使役动词 make 的习惯用法。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "1) make sth. done 使某物被做"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：make my hair cut 让我的头发被剪掉（剪头发）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "2) make sb./sth. + adj. 使某人/某物处于某种状态"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：They tried to "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "make her happy"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ", but in vain."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "他们设法使她高兴，但那是徒劳的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "3) make sb. do sth. = sb. be made to do sth. 使某人做某事"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：The heavy snowstorm "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "made"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the mountain climbers "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "stop"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " halfway."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
